  "strategy": "Lathliss, Dragon Queen makes a 5/5 flying Dragon token whenever another nontoken Dragon of yours enters, and pumps the whole flight for {1}{R}, so the deck ramps with Sol Ring, Arcane Signet and the Orbs of Dragonkind into a stream of Dragons that Dragonspeaker Shaman, Dragonlord's Servant and Herald's Horn make cheaper. Scourge of Valkas and Dragon Tempest turn every Dragon that lands into burn, Utvara Hellkite makes a 6/6 each time one attacks, and Crucible of Fire and Terror of Mount Velus end games in a single swing. The Elder Dragon War reads ahead to whichever chapter the table needs -- a sweep, a rummage or a Dragon -- and Blasphemous Act, Chaos Warp and Lightning Bolt answer the rest.",
